{"version":1,"key":"card:595","content":{"id":595,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"40ab97ad-418c-4457-95c8-515a0c5a7a19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设你需要部署你的网页，出于成本和维护的考虑，我们会选中云服务厂商，一般情况下我们都无法使用完整的一台计算机的能力，为了达成这一要求，云服务厂商会提供虚拟主机服务，虽然看上去你完整的使用了一台算力比较低的机器，实际上是使用部分计算机，云服务厂商会在在一个计算机上提供多个网站服务。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"959ef305-64d0-4b46-ba8a-71b549fb8589","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"既然是在一台物理服务上部署了多个服务，当请求过来时，如何区分那个虚拟主机进行处理呢，在 HTTP/1.0 时代，由于设计缺陷，在请求路径和请求头部中均无法知道主机信息，就无法主要请求的是哪一个虚拟主机。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"36202800-36d2-4307-9240-38998d5c52dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个典型的 HTTP/1,0 请求如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","uuid":"6d4e8bc0-153e-49e1-9513-3298235090b9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"591b9501-11ad-4390-8fc3-58fa034ebd9b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"GET /index.html HTTP/1.0\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; MSIE 5.0; Windows 98)\nAccept: text/html, image/*, application/xml;q=0.9, */*;q=0.8","collabId":"600d1c70-8cda-43ee-9a3d-ebec4ae1bf97","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"70480f7f-11e9-43f0-a085-ccc8d01e58a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是一些解决方案："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"ea21d826-0158-4365-948a-7d951ae9ef5f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9778c056-9d91-4ab8-8565-010ff0f34d2a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5044ebc9-79b7-4105-84ba-a2e1f4673646","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同路径"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"598da848-b7dd-47c5-a48c-beba9b850576","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如 /app1/index.html 就表示访问网站 App1，/app2/index.html 就表示访问网站 B"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"03969db1-ef88-4804-ad2d-2c017e1be3ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b6b4b069-429c-4bb0-908c-6dd054ccca4f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3dafcb5c-a558-4f5f-ae9e-1e4aab7dbfdc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7ec1cfce-1853-4122-8dda-2b4dc4220e37","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法使用主页 /index.html"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"42fd3188-610a-433e-9a7b-b99cda59be80","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f54c688d-ec28-4921-8534-b8aa6c9574ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要反向代理软件（Nginx、Apache）进行配置，维护成本高"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bb1895f2-4009-42e0-a5f3-a149f38fb822","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"267396a8-20ad-4fd7-8e94-646f56f35255","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用户还需要记住具体的路径"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"19b282b7-ee82-4d15-8536-9cf6285bbacb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"338b1bb7-2a51-4e99-9b52-4c4f91bcd0b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同端口"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bd446f39-7947-4286-93bc-c4fd48708a7a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给不同的网站服务提供不同的端口，比如 82 就表示访问网站 A，83 表示访问网站 B"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ca0afa56-14f6-4bfb-8c34-38058a7ec7a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点：对用户透明度较低，用户也许不想在它的地址上看到端口"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f8315d59-be99-4c06-8928-aa009c81a0c9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e3d60761-6b67-4010-b1de-fb68d3682205","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同 IP"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cb962117-5356-4f18-a0c2-0b00b0ba3509","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每一个虚拟主机分配一个唯一的 IP，所有的 IP 都绑定到物理服务器上"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e74743ab-dcd8-49df-9bd9-321c3cebe6d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"4bbbc3a5-e7e3-4e52-8bd2-548e1df92a46","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2f8b34bd-f092-4ac3-98bf-1dbac9108711","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4579bf23-5253-4417-b64c-5bfcc8155570","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IP 地址有限，托管成千上万虚拟主机的服务商无法获取到如此多的 IP 地址"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"de4c296c-d682-4e09-b553-c6f52b29dd12","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1e3d6755-0200-4d98-a146-ecda31b41083","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当服务商通过复制服务器来扩容时，可能会要求每个复制的服务器上的虚拟主机都需要一个新的唯一 IP"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"af4cb651-b247-4e51-a0d0-d0d4f60eaec9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ae74737a-4ca9-4be9-9e87-1a4521577495","children":[{"type":"content-link","contentId":1590,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":596,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"e3d173d8-6b1c-488d-975c-e169f37a6cab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Host 请求头部"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b50b3477-afcc-47d9-b41f-a1a4df30c520","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法区分虚拟主机的原因是浏览器只发送 URL 路径，如果在发送请求还能把主机信息加上，那么就可以区分虚拟主机，这就是 Host 请求头部的作用"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","uuid":"a739ba80-a3bb-403f-8a99-32521aa34b7d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b40744b2-502a-4d29-a31f-8fc1b5bf9d35","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"GET /index.html HTTP/1.1\nHost: www.example.com\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/118.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\nAccept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8\nAccept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.5\nConnection: keep-alive","collabId":"1ed70754-06b7-45fe-8c35-37c45c891966","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"b23138ec-6f72-4a1a-8d2b-29c7ab9026d6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c696c858-cbe7-4635-bfb0-89fd428ac1f0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于虚拟服务器的流行，绝大多数 HTTP 客户端（即使是不遵循 HTTP/1.1 的客户端）​，都实现了 Host 首部。"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6f13e50e-24b8-4377-bc3d-d38083fca313","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0495ada4-c4db-400a-b093-8c2ed930601d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2d7f78d0-abbe-46c4-8367-15fd4603d0df","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9fd3117-5666-4e5c-8a49-8aa345450098","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《HTTP 权威指南》，第 18 章，Web 主机托管"}]}]}]}],"tags":["HTTP/Host","虚拟主机"],"createTime":1752854397467,"updateTime":1763390834819,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763390834819},"links":{"card:596":{"key":"card:596","type":"card","id":596}}}